---
import EditPage from '../components/EditPage.astro';
---
<EditPage
      eyebrow="Legal"
      title="Shipping & Returns"
     lead="Placeholder shipping and returns policy. No live fulfillment exists in this build."
>
 <p>
   No fulfillment, shipping, or returns are processed in this DEMO build. A
    request is reviewed by a human and confirmed; there is no live payment and no
     shipment.
      </p>
     <p>
     In Phase C, a shipping/returns policy (fulfillment modes, lead times, and
      return conditions) is defined in the site configuration and finalized by the
       owner.
         </p>
 <p class="muted">No real shipping occurs in this DEMO build.</p>
</EditPage>
